error[E0277]: `*mut u64` is not a primitive a compare-exchange reads without changing
  --> tests/compile_fail/load_rmw_on_a_pointer.rs:10:52
   |
10 |     let _ = AtomicPtr::<u64>::new(ptr::null_mut()).load_rmw(Acquire);
   |                                                    ^^^^^^^^ expected `bool`, an integer or a `DoubleWord`
   |
   = help: the trait `ReadByExchange` is not implemented for `*mut u64`
   = note: a pointer's compare-exchange compares its address alone, so one of null for null would strip a null's provenance: for a pure-read load of a pointer, call `load`
note: required by a bound in `atomix_core::Atomic::<T>::load_rmw`
  --> src/atomic/mod.rs
   |
   | impl<T: Atom> Atomic<T> {
...
   |     pub fn load_rmw<O: LoadOrdering>(&self, order: O) -> T
   |     where
   |         T::Repr: ReadByExchange,
   |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `Atomic::<T>::load_rmw`
